stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  state "Being made" as Making
  state "Idle" as Idle
  state "Working" as Working
  state "Archived" as Archived
  [*] --> Making: creating (cwd, state)
  Making --> [*]: a creating hook throws
  Making --> Idle: created
  Idle --> Working: turnStart
  Working --> Idle: turnEnd
  Idle --> Archived: archiving, then archived
  Archived --> Idle: unarchiving, then unarchived
